h cooperation."},{"sourceSlug":"high-flame-elowen-orison","targetSlug":"brother-aldren","type":"former inquisitor and penitent colleague","publicDynamic":"Elowen once promoted Aldren; now he forces her to confront the harm their shared doctrine enabled.","privateTension":"Each holds a different piece of the Unbound Hymn."},{"sourceSlug":"dame-ysabet-rooke","targetSlug":"princess-elara-thornwall","type":"battlefield rivals with mutual respect","publicDynamic":"Each sees in the other the loyal soldier who may have to disobey a beloved sovereign.","privateTension":"Their cooperation can prevent a massacre at the summit."},{"sourceSlug":"princess-elara-thornwall","targetSlug":"lord-halric-thornwall","type":"siblings and succession enemies","publicDynamic":"They love the same father and opposite futures for the March.","privateTension":"Halric knows Elara leaks routes; Elara knows his marriage scheme."},{"sourceSlug":"princess-elara-thornwall","targetSlug":"maeve-redreed","type":"political allies with guarded attraction","publicDynamic":"Elara funds protections but Maeve refuses to become a respectable princess’s absolution.","privateTension":"The mutiny tests whether reform and labor power can trust each other."},{"sourceSlug":"brina-forgehand","targetSlug":"sera-blackvein","type":"mentor and secret student","publicDynamic":"Brina teaches sabotage; Sera teaches her the deep metal is alive.","privateTension":"Both must decide whether destroying the mine saves or kills the buried dragon."},{"sourceSlug":"queen-selene-ravaryn","targetSlug":"prince-aurel-ravaryn","type":"mother and political instrument","publicDynamic":"Their love is fierce, compromised by Selene’s inability to separate her son from his claim.","privateTension":"Aurel’s abdication may be experienced as betrayal or liberation."},{"sourceSlug":"admiral-nyra-greymere","targetSlug":"duchess-mirelle-greymere","type":"fostered hostage and birth-house ruler","publicDynamic":"Mirelle expects loyalty from blood; Nyra gives loyalty only to crews.","privateTension":"The prison fleet forces Nyra to choose a public banner."},{"sourceSlug":"ilyra-ashscale","targetSlug":"rhevan-crownsbane","type":"dragonkeepers divided by method","publicDynamic":"Ilyra favors immediate release; Rhevan fears traumatized dragons will make freedom catastrophic.","privateTension":"Their shared dreams reveal the eggs’ conditions."},{"sourceSlug":"duchess-aveline-edevane","targetSlug":"lord-rowan-edevane","type":"loving siblings and strategic opponents","publicDynamic":"Aveline risks transformation; Rowan protects continuity. Each believes the other’s virtue could destroy the Reach.","privateTension":"The courier death and awakening order end their polite stalemate."},{"sourceSlug":"freya-hart","targetSlug":"lord-rowan-edevane","type":"sworn ranger and compromised commander","publicDynamic":"Freya trusts Rowan’s restraint until she learns he sent her after a courier using false intelligence.","privateTension":"Truth may break the ranger command or remake it."},{"sourceSlug":"lyssa-bramble","targetSlug":"prince-aurel-ravaryn","type":"anonymous affection complicated by identity","publicDynamic":"They met without titles, liked one another before recognition, and now distrust the political meaning of every remembered tenderness.","privateTension":"Their song and abdication arcs intersect."},{"sourceSlug":"duchess-mirelle-greymere","targetSlug":"lord-cassian-greymere","type":"siblings competing over sovereignty","publicDynamic":"Mirelle wants declared freedom; Cassian wants recognized freedom.","privateTension":"The charter forces a public choice between them."},{"sourceSlug":"delphine-lantern","targetSlug":"idris-salt","type":"covert collaborators who do not trust each other","publicDynamic":"Delphine needs his keys and despises his compromises; Idris needs her routes and fears her judgment.","privateTension":"The copied route map could have come from either network."},{"sourceSlug":"bastian-crow","targetSlug":"idris-salt","type":"widower and responsible official","publicDynamic":"Bastian does not know Idris signed the transfer that led to his spouse’s death.","privateTension":"The prison records can produce accountability, vengeance, or difficult cooperation."},{"sourceSlug":"asha-ren","targetSlug":"liora-saintless","type":"leader and keeper of her discarded crown","publicDynamic":"Liora protects Asha from saint worship while withholding the signet that could expose her.","privateTension":"Their trust determines whether Asha enters the Vault by choice."},{"sourceSlug":"asha-ren","targetSlug":"nia-chainbreaker","type":"closest friends and political counterweights","publicDynamic":"Nia refuses to let Asha’s symbolism outrank camp law; Asha relies on that refusal more than praise.","privateTension":"A royal identity reveal tests equality between them."},{"sourceSlug":"petra-glass","targetSlug":"rhevan-crownsbane","type":"echo guide and living memory bearer","publicDynamic":"Petra hears fragments Rhevan carries internally; together they can reconstruct the Glassing.","privateTension":"Rhevan may hold the final memory of Petra’s mother."},{"sourceSlug":"king-edric-thornwall","targetSlug":"lady-rowena-thornwall","type":"siblings who built a kingdom","publicDynamic":"Rowena made Edric’s war possible and knows his claim is false.","privateTension":"Her requisition record can end his reign."},{"sourceSlug":"lord-halric-thornwall","targetSlug":"queen-selene-ravaryn","type":"secret prospective spouses and mutual predators","publicDynamic":"Each admires the other’s discipline and plans to dominate the resulting monarchy.","privateTension":"Their draft compact is a loaded weapon against both families."},{"sourceSlug":"sabine-silk-veyl","targetSlug":"liora-saintless","type":"Compact founders divided by legitimacy","publicDynamic":"Sabine seeks enforceable crown law; Liora believes recognition becomes surveillance.","privateTension":"Velvet Law requires both signatures."},{"sourceSlug":"sabine-silk-veyl","targetSlug":"nessa-honeybell-marrow","type":"house colleagues","publicDynamic":"Sabine “Silk” Veyl and Nessa “Honeybell” Marrow keep the same floor law and do not always keep the same heart.","privateTension":"A royal client is trying to buy her exclusive contract and break Sabine’s Compact in the same stroke."},{"sourceSlug":"maeve-redreed","targetSlug":"catrin-brann","type":"house colleagues","publicDynamic":"Maeve Redreed and Catrin Brann keep the same floor law and do not always keep the same heart.","privateTension":"An officers’ clique is trying to mark her as camp property; Maeve’s mutiny may make Catrin the first example."},{"sourceSlug":"celessa-vane","targetSlug":"vespera-saan","type":"house colleagues","publicDynamic":"Celessa Vane and Vespera Saan keep the same floor law and do not always keep the same heart.","privateTension":"A Ravaryn diplomat wants her as a bonded tutor-consort; accepting would give the Veil protection and put her back in a purchase contract."},{"sourceSlug":"delphine-lantern","targetSlug":"rorik-pell","type":"house colleagues","publicDynamic":"Delphine Lantern and Rorik Pell keep the same floor law and do not always keep the same heart.","privateTension":"A Tidevault warrant still names him; Idris could take him tomorrow, and Delphine is hiding the paper in the lantern loft."}],"socialConnections":[{"sourceSlug":"queen-maerra-vaelorian","targetSlug":"lady-isolde-morcant","relationshipType":"trusted contact","affinity":0.78,"trust":0.7,"tension":0.08,"publicDynamic":"They know one another through crownspire, shared work, faction overlap, or repeated travel.","privateTension":"Their loyalties and private wants do not align perfectly.","knowledgeScope":"direct","authored":true},{"sourceSlug":"queen-maerra-vaelorian","targetSlug":"high-flame-elowen-orison","relationshipType":"social circle","affinity":0.72,"trust":0.6499999999999999,"tension":0.08,"publicDynamic":"They know one another through crownspire, shared w